Śatrughna condemns woman-driven exile and passive Lakṣmaṇa --- Mantharā appears adorned at eastern door --- Doorkeeper seizes hunchback for Śatrughna --- Śatrughna orders attendants to seize wailing Mantharā --- Śatrughna drags wailing Mantharā scattering vessels across palace --- Frightened friends flee to Kausalyā refuge --- Śatrughna reviles cowering Kaikēyī with harsh words --- Bharata forbids killing women citing Rāma blame --- Śatrughna releases Mantharā at Bharata word --- Kaikēyī soothes fallen Mantharā like trapped krauñcī
